# lane.slowtier2 2026-09-28: two frames added after the mark (play1, play2); the route to the mark is unchanged (docs/lanes/slowtier2/addshots.py).
# BloodRayne (4D4A0001): one route for every run (New Game writes no save
# before control). PLAYED by nav.py on the Thor, 2026-09-27 13:15 PDT
# (lane.titleroutes HELD session bloodrayne.first-run-20260927T131543).
#
#   the Terminal Reality and Majesco logos (A, A) -> New Game, cursor on
#   "Training" (hat down, to "Act 1 - Louisiana"; A) -> Choose difficulty
#   level, cursor on Normal (A) -> the Control scheme text (A) -> Choose
#   control scheme, 1st person / Normal (hat down twice, to "Start Game"; A)
#   -> load -> the in-engine opening with Mynce (A does not end it; about
#   70 s) -> Rayne on the grass below the church, health bar and compass.
#
# The highlighted menu entry is the DIM one. The left stick does not move
# these menus; the hat does (`axis HATY max`, 0.15 s, `mid`).
#
# The two A presses through the logos are the fragile part: they are
# counted, and a cold boot may pace the logos differently. The `newgame`
# frame shows whether the cursor reached "Act 1 - Louisiana". If it shows
# "Training" selected or another menu, the run is in the wrong place.
# "Training" is playable too, but its tutorial cutscenes interrupt control.
#
# Player control: LY min walked Rayne from the grass to the church wall
# (nav frames 005-cut3 -> 006-moved), RX turned the camera (008-played).
#
# Replayed once, 13:20 PDT, unattended, hakuX holding the input focus on all
# 14 reads: gameplay at the mark (scratch/replay/bloodrayne-132018/). That
# replay's play pattern walked forward only, and in 40 s it took her into
# the swamp water, which drains her health. The pattern below walks forward
# 1 s and back 1 s around a turn, so she stays by the church.
#
# REPLAYED with this pattern 2026-09-27 13:38 PDT, as a held soak
# (soak_title.sh in our hold, MAX regimen, apk f5abfa521745 = ref
# a593d8eb85; scratch/held/bloodrayne-20260927T133838): the mark frame is
# Rayne at the church wall, overlay FPS 22, and hakuX held the input focus
# on all 34 reads. 288 s of gameplay, fps window median 22.89 (min 5.48),
# 0% at >= 30. The frame rate fell from 20-26 to 6-7 at 390 s (144 s after
# the mark) and stayed there: the shape of the Thor's thermal pause (#507).
# The title's rate in this place is the 20-26.
wait 35.1
press A 300
wait 8.6
press A 300
wait 10.2
axis HATY max
wait 0.4
axis HATY mid
wait 1.6
shot newgame
wait 16.9
press A 300
wait 5.7
press A 300
wait 8.6
press A 300
wait 5.3
axis HATY max
wait 0.4
axis HATY mid
wait 1.7
axis HATY max
wait 0.4
axis HATY mid
wait 1.6
shot scheme
wait 3.8
press A 300
wait 30.1
shot act1load
wait 11.4
press A 300
wait 6.1
shot skip
wait 24.7
shot cut2
wait 28.1
shot cut3
wait 13.1
axis LY min
wait 2.7
axis LY mid
wait 0.6
shot moved
wait 1.1
mark gameplay
repeat 16 {
    axis LY min
    wait 1
    axis LY mid
    axis RX max
    wait 0.5
    axis RX mid
    press X
    wait 0.5
    axis LY max
    wait 1
    axis LY mid
    axis RT max
    wait 0.3
    axis RT min
    wait 0.5
}
shot play1
repeat 21 {
    axis LY min
    wait 1
    axis LY mid
    axis RX max
    wait 0.5
    axis RX mid
    press X
    wait 0.5
    axis LY max
    wait 1
    axis LY mid
    axis RT max
    wait 0.3
    axis RT min
    wait 0.5
}
shot play2
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 1
    axis LY mid
    axis RX max
    wait 0.5
    axis RX mid
    press X
    wait 0.5
    axis LY max
    wait 1
    axis LY mid
    axis RT max
    wait 0.3
    axis RT min
    wait 0.5
}
